    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2>Welcome to LAZERZ! The fast paced, free to play movement shooter. Master the art of hydraulic power movement and wall running. Fly like an angel through the arena and shoot with powerful ricocheting lazerz to obliterate your enemies with style!<br><br>LAZERZ currently offers Free For All chaos, the precursor ranking for highly detailed statistics about your ingame performance and tons of character customization and cosmetics.<br><br><strong><i>Let's shoot some lazerz... with style!</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896440/extras/fee0d7ea3889c5749cb81a8394f7d5b0.poster.avif?t=1714425716\" width=528 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896440/extras/fee0d7ea3889c5749cb81a8394f7d5b0.webm?t=1714425716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896440/extras/fee0d7ea3889c5749cb81a8394f7d5b0.mp4?t=1714425716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896440/extras/390e23fe8cc0a8ceb431181d2b3dfd7f.poster.avif?t=1714425716\" width=528 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896440/extras/390e23fe8cc0a8ceb431181d2b3dfd7f.webm?t=1714425716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896440/extras/390e23fe8cc0a8ceb431181d2b3dfd7f.mp4?t=1714425716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebounds</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt